ion":"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"2271930","steamName":"IfSunSets","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2271930/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:32:16.846663+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"「IfSunSets」 is a survival RPG adventure game. During the day, secure necessary supplies across the island, and survive the night against strong and terrifying monsters that track you down. You can utilize resources you've secured to build a base to fend off threatening monsters.","detailedDescription":"IfSunSets is an open-world survival adventure RPG set on the mysterious island of Luminora, brimming with pirate lore and legends of a Kraken.\n\nBy day, explore the vast, beautiful land to collect resources, hunt, farm, fish, craft weapons, build fortifications, and improve your skills for battles against cursed monsters and powerful bosses from forgotten times.\n\nOnce the sun sets, the island is shrouded in darkness and transforms into a land of death. Arm yourself and survive the hordes of undead to see another morning!\n\nEmbark on a mysterious journey to the island, sail across the ocean, and claim islands as your own!\n\nBecome a pirate and sail the seas!\n\nExperience intense naval battles between pirates across the vast ocean.\nAim at enemy pirate ships and dominate the battlefield with perfectly timed cannon fire.\nYour aim will sway with the waves, and strategic positioning will determine victory or defeat.\nA single shot can turn the tide of battle.\n\nBuild your own pirate ship!\n\nChoose your hull, sails, and cannons to complete your own pirate ship.\nWhether you prioritize speed, firepower, or durability is entirely up to your strategy.\nExperiment with countless combinations to build the ultimate ship that can survive any situation.\n\nEXPLORE THE MYSTERIOUS ISLAND DURING THE DAY!\n\nStranded on the island with nothing but the clothes on your back, you begin your journey of survival. Travel across the shores, jungles, and deserts of this vast open world. Collect mysterious items like “Cthugha Stones” to endure the dangers of this cursed island. Venture deeper into the island and uncover the ancient secrets it has concealed from the world.\n\nBUILD YOUR SURVIVAL STRATEGY AND WARD OFF THE HORRORS OF THE NIGHT!\n\nWhen night falls, a vast horde of undead emerges. They will pursue you no matter where you hide. Build your own custom fortress to prepare for nightfall. Set up traps and obstacles to protect yourself from the night of the dead. Construct your fortifications with defense in mind!\n\nEXPERIENCE AN ENGAGING BATTLE SYSTEM!\n\nThe ancient souls confined to the island are hunting you. Strengthen your stats and sharpen your combat skills for the battles that await. Engage in an action-packed battle system and defeat countless enemies!\n\nExperience the underwater ecosystem!\n\nThe depths of the ocean are an unknown frontier, filled with ancient relics, breathtaking locations, and dangerous marine life.\nThrough underwater exploration, you can obtain valuable resources that aid your survival and growth.\n\nTEAM UP AND EXPLORE THE ISLAND TOGETHER!\n\nWork together, share resources, and strategize for survival. Join forces with your allies to face the lurking dangers of Luminora!","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271930/b891be414f976cd22bb5dfc766654d1fd9d22775/header.jpg?t=1791447506"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271930/1d6488fef3d4be7ed32cab38f662eab7feef21c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791447506"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/